</a></li><li><a href="/genres/simulation">Simulation</a></li><li><a href="/genres/strategy">Strategy</a></li><li><a href="/genres/sports">Sports</a></li><li><a href="/genres/racing">Racing</a></li><li><a href="/genres/massively-multiplayer">MMO</a></li><li><a href="/genres/free-to-play">Free to play</a></li></ul></div></nav><div class="footer__bottom"><div class="footer__notes"><span>Game data from public Steam store pages. GameDB.ai is not affiliated with Valve.</span><span class="footer__proto">Revenue and wishlists are GameDB estimates · AI labels are read from each game’s Steam disclosure</span><span class="footer__legal"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><button type="button" data-open-consent="">Cookie settings</button></span></div><div class="theme-switch" role="group" aria-label="Color theme"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-moon"></use></svg>Dark</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-sun"></use></svg>Light</button></div></div></div></footer><dialog class="modal" id="claim-dialog" aria-labelledby="claim-title"><div class="modal__form"><header class="modal__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">For developers</p><h2 id="claim-title">Claim your game</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn" aria-label="Close"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-x"></use></svg></button></header><form class="modal__stack" noValidate=""><p class="modal__lede">Steam games with an AI disclosure are added automatically, several times a day. Claim yours to confirm how it uses AI: it gets a Verified badge next to its name, and you can tell the story behind it.</p><label class="field" for="claim-url"><span>Your game on Steam</span><input id="claim-url" type="url" placeholder="https://store.steampowered.com/app/…" aria-invalid="false" name="url" value=""/></label><footer class="modal__foot"><span class="modal__note">No claim is needed to stay listed.</span><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost">Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Continue</button></footer></form></div></dialog><dialog class="modal modal--auth" id="signin-dialog" aria-labelledby="signin-title"><div class="modal__form auth"><header class="modal__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">GameDB.ai</p><h2 id="signin-title">Sign in</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn" aria-label="Close"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-x"></use></svg></button></header><p class="modal__lede">Keep your stars on every device, and claim the games you make.</p><a class="btn btn--lg btn--steam" href="/auth/steam"><svg class="i i--fill i--brand" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M11.979 0C5.678 0 .511 4.86.022 11.037l6.432 2.658c.545-.371 1.203-.59 1.912-.59.063 0 .125.004.188.006l2.861-4.142V8.91c0-2.495 2.028-4.524 4.524-4.524 2.494 0 4.524 2.031 4.524 4.527s-2.03 4.525-4.524 4.525h-.105l-4.076 2.911c0 .052.004.105.004.159 0 1.875-1.515 3.396-3.39 3.396-1.635 0-3.016-1.173-3.331-2.727L.436 15.27C1.862 20.307 6.486 24 11.979 24c6.627 0 11.999-5.373 11.999-12S18.605 0 11.979 0zM7.54 18.21l-1.473-.61c.262.543.714.999 1.314 1.25 1.297.539 2.793-.076 3.332-1.375.263-.63.264-1.319.005-1.949s-.75-1.121-1.377-1.383c-.624-.26-1.29-.249-1.878-.03l1.523.63c.956.4 1.409 1.5 1.009 2.455-.397.957-1.497 1.41-2.454 1.012H7.54zm11.415-9.303c0-1.662-1.353-3.015-3.015-3.015-1.665 0-3.015 1.353-3.015 3.015 0 1.665 1.35 3.015 3.015 3.015 1.663 0 3.015-1.35 3.015-3.015zm-5.273-.005c0-1.252 1.013-2.266 2.265-2.266 1.249 0 2.266 1.014 2.266 2.266 0 1.251-1.017 2.265-2.266 2.265-1.253 0-2.265-1.014-2.265-2.265z"></path></svg>Continue with Steam</a><div class="auth__or" role="separator"><span>or</span></div><form class="auth__form" noValidate=""><label class="field" for="signin-email"><span>Email</span><input id="signin-email" type="email" inputMode="email" autoComplete="email" placeholder="you@studio.com" aria-invalid="false" name="email" value=""/></label><button type="submit" class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg">Email me a code</button></form><p class="auth__fine">No password needed. We use your email only to sign you in and about games you claim. By signing in, you agree to our <a target="_blank" href="/terms">Terms</a> and <a target="_blank" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><div class="auth__captcha"></div></div></dialog><div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/36k8in9a291ok.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><div hidden id="S:0"><section class="g-hero" data-game-name="Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure"><div class="g-hero__art"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/aecdadf42af19796048475db9275cc2014383d2c/library_hero.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="" decoding="async"/></div><div class="container g-hero__inner"><div class="g-poster"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/b085a35137e3a6fb3f105545718ca5c500bdfc49/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure cover art" fetchPriority="high"/></div><div class="g-head"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Games</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="/trending">Released</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="/genres/rpg">RPG</a><span class="sep">/</span><span aria-current="page">Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure</span></nav><div class="g-badges"><a class="badge badge--rank" href="/trending"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-trend"></use></svg>#<!-- -->10<!-- --> Trending · <!-- -->Released</a><span class="badge"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg>Released Oct 29, 2026</span></div><h1 class="g-title">Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure</h1><p class="g-by">by <a href="#developer">StandinFire Studio</a><span class="dot-sep">·</span><span>RPG, Casual, Indie</span></p><p class="g-standfirst">Some music tracks began as AI output and were edited by hand; AI helped draft store text; no AI art.</p><div class="chips"><span class="ai-chip" title="Music &amp; SFX — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-audio"></use></svg><span>Music &amp; SFX</span><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="vh"> (<!-- -->Partial<!-- -->)</span></span><span class="ai-chip" title="Marketing — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-marketing"></use></svg><span>Marketing</span><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="vh"> (<!-- -->Partial<!-- -->)</span></span></div><div class="g-actions"><button type="button" class="star-btn star-btn--glass" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Star Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure"><span class="star-btn__main"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-star"></use></svg><span class="star-btn__label">Star</span></span><span class="star-btn__count">0</span></button><a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5147000/?utm_source=gamedb.ai&amp;utm_medium=referral" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-list="hero">View on Steam<svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-external"></use></svg></a><a class="btn btn--glass" href="https://x.com/StandinFireGame" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Visit @StandinFireGame on X"><svg class="i i--fill i--brand" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.234 10.162 22.977 0h-2.072l-7.591 8.824L7.251 0H.258l9.168 13.343L.258 24H2.33l8.016-9.318L16.749 24h6.993zm-2.837 3.299-.929-1.329L3.076 1.56h3.182l5.965 8.532.929 1.329 7.754 11.09h-3.182z"></path></svg>@StandinFireGame</a><button type="button" class="btn btn--glass"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-share"></use></svg>Share</button></div></div></div></section><div id="subnav-sentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="subnav" id="subnav"><div class="container subnav__inner"><nav class="subnav__links" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#summary">Summary</a><a href="#ai">How AI is used</a><a href="#growth">Growth</a><a href="#rankings">Rankings</a><a href="#developer">Developer</a><a href="#similar">Similar games</a></nav><div class="subnav__mini"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/8fee24038c115d6d29f207ce1ac66ba0d272596b/header.jpg?t=1793271766" alt=""/><b>Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure</b><button type="button" class="star-btn star-btn--compact" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Star Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure"><span class="star-btn__main"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-star"></use></svg><span class="star-btn__label">Star</span></span><span class="star-btn__count">0</span></button></div></div></div><div class="container g-layout"><div class="g-main"><section class="g-section" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title"><h2 class="vh" id="overview-title">Overview</h2><div class="viewer"><div class="viewer__stage"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257410657/5bbc4e2cbdbc5fd71b46e62246e40d4c3dcd60d6/movie_full.jpg" alt="Gameplay Trailer"/><button type="button" class="viewer__play"><svg class="i i--fill" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-play"></use></svg>Watch trailer</button><span class="viewer__caption">Gameplay Trailer</span></div><div class="filmstrip" role="list" aria-label="Trailer and screenshots"><button type="button" role="listitem" class="film is-active" aria-label="Trailer"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257410657/5bbc4e2cbdbc5fd71b46e62246e40d4c3dcd60d6/movie_600x337.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"/><span class="film__play"><svg class="i i--fill" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-play"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" role="listitem" class="film" aria-label="Screenshot 1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/a6bc1206ce929fece4966cb45fe0ab72c20d654b/ss_a6bc1206ce929fece4966cb45fe0ab72c20d654b.600x338.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="" loading="lazy"/></button><button type="button" role="listitem" class="film" aria-label="Screenshot 2"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/bef28d6a89bea82a04f0a22a3abc0464f321b8f6/ss_bef28d6a89bea82a04f0a22a3abc0464f321b8f6.600x338.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="" loading="lazy"/></button><button type="button" role="listitem" class="film" aria-label="Screenshot 3"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/a6e5cee328412c1663b4f8bb189180bd1d1c771e/ss_a6e5cee328412c1663b4f8bb189180bd1d1c771e.600x338.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="" loading="lazy"/></button><button type="button" role="listitem" class="film" aria-label="Screenshot 4"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/fa011715419ccfc74efb78562c4f0d931deb6cb2/ss_fa011715419ccfc74efb78562c4f0d931deb6cb2.600x338.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="" loading="lazy"/></button><button type="button" role="listitem" class="film" aria-label="Screenshot 5"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/4f8c65d82e2ce99be3b0a47d7e8f6fc4f7186d1f/ss_4f8c65d82e2ce99be3b0a47d7e8f6fc4f7186d1f.600x338.jpg?t=1793271766" alt="" loading="lazy"/></button></div></div><p class="about__text">An idle collection RPG that keeps adventuring on your desktop. Build a team of three Dreamspirits, combine roles, skills, equipment, and innate affixes, then push farther through auto-battles, hatching, fusion, and talent progression.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">RPG</span><span class="tag">Idler</span><span class="tag">Casual</span><span class="tag">Auto Battler</span><span class="tag">Desktop Companion</span><span class="tag">Party-Based RPG</span><span class="tag">Team-Based</span><span class="tag">Fantasy</span><span class="tag">Loot</span><span class="tag">Automation</span></div></section><section class="g-section" id="summary" aria-labelledby="summary-title"><div class="g-section__head"><h2 id="summary-title">Summary</h2></div><div class="kpis"><div class="kpi kpi--live"><span class="kpi__label">Playing now</span><span class="kpi__value">375</span><span class="kpi__delta">24h peak 473</span><span class="kpi__src">Steam · hourly</span></div><div class="kpi"><span class="kpi__label">Steam followers</span><span class="kpi__value">202</span><span class="kpi__delta"><b class="up">+97</b> this week</span><span class="kpi__src">Steam · public</span></div><div class="kpi"><span class="kpi__label">Steam reviews</span><span class="kpi__value">88%</span><span class="kpi__delta">Positive · 26</span><span class="kpi__src">Steam · public</span></div><div class="kpi kpi--est"><span class="kpi__label">Revenue <span class="estbadge" tabindex="0" data-tip-title="GameDB estimate" data-tip="Gross Steam revenue ≈ reviews × 40 sales per review (likely 25–60) × list price × 0.65 for discounts and regional prices, before Steam’s cut, refunds and taxes. From public data, not reported sales.">est.</span></span><span class="kpi__value">$4.7K</span><span class="kpi__delta">Likely $3K–$7.1K</span><span class="kpi__src">GameDB estimate</span></div></div></section><section class="g-section" id="ai" aria-labelledby="ai-title"><div class="g-section__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">AI disclosure</p><h2 id="ai-title">How AI is used</h2></div><span class="src"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-link"></use></svg>Source: <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5147000/?utm_source=gamedb.ai&amp;utm_medium=referral" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Steam AI disclosure</a> · checked <!-- -->Oct 31, 2026</span></div><article class="ai-label" aria-label="AI use label"><div class="ai-label__top"><p class="ai-label__title">GameDB AI label</p><span class="src">AI in 2 of 8 areas</span></div><ul class="descriptors"><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="In-game AI: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-live"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">In-game AI</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Code: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-code"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Code</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-notused" title="Art: the developer says AI isn’t used here"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-art"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Art</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not used</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-used" title="Music &amp; SFX — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-audio"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Music &amp; SFX</span><span class="desc-tile__scope"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Voice: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-voice"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Voice</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Writing: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-writing"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Writing</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Translation: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-translation"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Translation</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-used" title="Marketing — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-marketing"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Marketing</span><span class="desc-tile__scope"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></li></ul><div class="ai-details"><div class="ai-detail"><div class="ai-detail__area"><span class="ai-detail__name"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-audio"></use></svg>Music &amp; SFX</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>Generative AI created initial versions of some music tracks, which were manually edited into loopable versions.</p></div></div><div class="ai-detail"><div class="ai-detail__area"><span class="ai-detail__name"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-marketing"></use></svg>Marketing</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>AI assisted with drafting and editing some store page descriptions.</p></div></div></div><dl class="ai-facts"><div><dt>Not used, per the developer</dt><dd><span class="muted-list"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-art"></use></svg>Art</span></span></dd></div><div><dt>Not mentioned</dt><dd><span class="muted-list"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-live"></use></svg>In-game AI</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-code"></use></svg>Code</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-voice"></use></svg>Voice</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-writing"></use></svg>Writing</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-translation"></use></svg>Translation</span></span></dd></div></dl><details class="disclosure"><summary><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-chevron"></use></svg>Read the full disclosure<small>Quoted from the Steam store page</small></summary><blockquote><p>No generative AI was used to create the game&#x27;s visual art or artwork. Generative AI was used to create the initial versions of some music tracks, which were then manually edited and adapted into loopable versions for use in the game. AI was also used to assist with drafting and editing some store page descriptions.</p></blockquote></details><div class="ai-label__foot"><div class="scope-legend"><span><span class="meter meter--core" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Core</span><span><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span><span><span class="meter meter--assist" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Assist</span><span><span class="meter meter--prototype" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Placeholder</span></div><button type="button" class="link-quiet" data-proto="Corrections open a short form — coming soon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-flag"></use></svg>Suggest a correction</button></div></article></section><section class="g-section" id="growth" aria-labelledby="growth-title"><div class="g-section__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Players · followers</p><h2 id="growth-title">Growth</h2></div></div><div class="chart-card"><div class="chart-card__head"><div><h3 class="chart-card__title">Players online</h3><p class="chart-card__sub">Last 7 days, hourly · now 375 · 24h peak 473</p></div><div class="chart-card__tools"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-table"></use></svg>Table</button></div></div><div class="chart" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Players online, last 7 days, hourly: 3 at Oct 29, 11:00 UTC, 375 now. Use the arrow keys to read hourly values."><svg viewBox="0 0 640 290" width="640" height="290" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g class="grid"><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="260.0" y2="260.0" class="base"></line><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="179.3" y2="179.3"></line><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="98.7" y2="98.7"></line><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="18.0" y2="18.0"></line></g><g class="axis"><text x="42" y="263.5" text-anchor="end">0</text><text x="42" y="182.8" text-anchor="end">200</text><te